# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day18

## Question

Tell me about a time when something surprised you.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- When it happened
- Where you were
- What you expected
- What actually happened
- Why you were surprised
- How you felt afterward

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> What surprised me was...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

I expected...

↓

But...

↓

What surprised me was...

↓

I felt...

↓

In the end...
